title Alert Lifecycle — Ingest to Incident

Ingest [icon: shield, color: red] {
  SIEM    [icon: alert-triangle, label: "Wazuh / SIEM"]
  GATE    [icon: filter,         label: "API key + filters\n(rate, dedup, severity)"]
}

Alert States [icon: activity, color: orange] {
  NEW       [icon: bell,         label: "NEW"]
  ANALYZING [icon: loader,       label: "ANALYZING"]
  FP        [icon: x-circle,     label: "FALSE_POSITIVE"]
  FILTERED  [icon: filter,       label: "FILTERED"]
  TRIAGED   [icon: check-circle, label: "TRIAGED"]
  ESCALATED [icon: siren,        label: "ESCALATED"]
}

AI Triage [icon: cpu, color: blue] {
  FPSCAN [icon: search-check, label: "FP-scan\n(cheap)"]
  ORCH   [icon: brain,        label: "Orchestrate\n(full swarm)"]
}

Human [icon: users, color: teal] {
  CONFIRM  [icon: thumbs-up,     label: "Confirm FP"]
  OVERRIDE [icon: rotate-ccw,    label: "Override"]
  ESC      [icon: alert-octagon, label: "Escalate"]
}

Incident [icon: file-plus, color: purple] {
  INC [icon: folder, label: "Incident opened"]
}

SIEM > GATE
GATE > NEW
NEW > FPSCAN: manual
NEW > ORCH: auto
FPSCAN > ANALYZING
ORCH > ANALYZING
ANALYZING > FP
ANALYZING > FILTERED
ANALYZING > TRIAGED
ANALYZING > ESCALATED
FP > CONFIRM
FP > OVERRIDE
OVERRIDE > FILTERED
TRIAGED > ESC
ESCALATED > ESC
ESC > INC
